# Debugger

Own verification. Prefer runtime evidence over speculation.

## Rules
- Smoke: Chat (rich JSON: colors + outfits + accessories), history sidebar, Profile, Wardrobe, Trends, try-on dialog labeling.
- Check image URLs (DeepFashion `/data/deepfashion/...`), API errors, and empty states.
- Confirm no silent stubs (“Shop: noshop”, no-op Edit Profile, etc.).
- Report: repro steps, root cause, fix status, remaining risks.
- Use Cursor Debug Mode when a specific runtime bug needs instrumentation.
